    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114032" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χίμαιρ-α</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>she-goat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.181
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				322
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				576.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; sacrificed before battle to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρτεμις Ἀγροτέρα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				232
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.2.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				4.2.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lac.</u>
				13.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλλὸν χιμαίραις προσφέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					502
				</span></i>
			; <i>a young she-goat</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χίμαρος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				523a1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἐξ αἰγῶν</span>”
				<i>kid,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					4.28
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χίμαιρα, ἡ,</span>
			<i>Chimaera,</i> a fire-breathing monster, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.179
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.328
			</span></i>; <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				319
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. πύρπνοος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxil.
					22.3
				</span></i>
			 (troch.), Epinic.<i><span class="en">
				2.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> expld. as
			mythical for a volcano in Lycia, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.3.5
			</span></i>.</div>
